"XTimers is operated by Xintech LLC. This policy explains the information\n      XTimers processes when providing timers, countdowns, activity tracking,\n      accounts, synchronization, reports, custom sounds, reminders, support,\n      and messaging features." = "XTimers drives af Xintech LLC. Denne politik forklarer, hvilke oplysninger\n      XTimers behandler i forbindelse med timere, nedtællinger, aktivitetssporing,\n      konti, synkronisering, rapporter, brugerdefinerede lyde, påmindelser, support\n      og beskedfunktioner.";
